          },
          {
            "index": 20,
            "role": "assistant",
            "text": "I found seven reservations. There are two on the same date, **May 17, 2024**:\n\n- **SE9KEL** — LAX to BOS, round trip; flights HAT034 and HAT026 on May 17, then return flights on May 29. This reservation is for Ivan Brown and Emma Li.\n- **FDZ0T5** — JFK to PHL, one way; flights HAT079 and HAT289 on May 17. This reservation is for you.\n\nI also found **HTR26G** for MSP to DFW on May 16, and **5BGGWZ** with a return flight on May 17. The other reservations are on May 22 and May 27–30."
          },
          {
            "index": 21,
            "role": "user",
            "text": "Okay, so let me get this straight. I know I'm arriving in New York from Dallas on May 17, and I'm leaving Boston on May 22. So which of these actually fits that?"
