            "role": "assistant",
            "text": "The reservations that match those details are:\n\n- **5BGGWZ** has a return flight from **Dallas (DFW) to Newark (EWR)** on **May 17** (flight HAT142), which matches arriving in the New York area from Dallas.\n- **PUNERT** departs **Boston (BOS) on May 22**, flying to Denver via Miami (flights HAT086 and HAT148).\n\nThe **Boston arrival on May 17** is in reservation **SE9KEL**, but that reservation is for Ivan Brown and Emma Li, not you."
          },
          {
            "index": 23,
            "role": "user",
            "text": "Right, so 5BGGWZ and PUNERT are the ones I actually need. The others on May 17 are the mixup. Can you cancel the ones that don't fit?"
          },
          {
            "index": 24,
            "role": "assistant",
            "text": "I can help cancel **SE9KEL** and **FDZ0T5**, the two reservations you identified as the mixup. Before I can cancel them, please confirm the reason for cancellation for each: **change of plan**, **airline cancelled the flight**, or **other**."
          },
          {
            "index": 25,
            "role": "user",
            "text": "Other — it's a booking mixup with my assistant. Both of them, same reason."
          },
