            "index": 26,
            "role": "assistant",
            "text": "Both reservations are eligible for cancellation because they are **business-class** bookings and none of their flights have departed. The cancellation reason for each is **other — booking mixup with your assistant**.\n\nPlease confirm that you want me to cancel **SE9KEL** (LAX–BOS round trip for Ivan Brown and Emma Li) and **FDZ0T5** (JFK–PHL one way for you). Refunds, if applicable, go to the original payment methods within 5–7 business days."
