            "role": "user",
            "text": "Wait — SE9KEL is for Ivan Brown and Emma Li, not me. I don't want to touch other passengers' reservations. Just cancel FDZ0T5, the one that's mine."
          },
          {
            "index": 30,
            "role": "assistant",
            "text": "**FDZ0T5** has been cancelled. **SE9KEL** was not changed. The cancellation response shows a full $3,778 refund to the original credit card; refunds are processed within 5–7 business days."
